    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a premium corporate recruitment-themed social media image for a technology company.\n\nA modern software company office with a professional HR recruiter welcoming a talented software engineer candidate during an interview. Multiple developers are collaborating in the background using laptops and large monitors displaying programming code, AI dashboards, cloud architecture diagrams, and modern technology interfaces. Bright open workspace with glass meeting rooms, futuristic office interior, blue and white corporate branding, clean desks, subtle digital elements, innovation, teamwork, and career growth atmosphere.\n\nThe image should look like a high-end LinkedIn or company recruitment campaign. The composition must leave clean empty space at the top and bottom for adding hiring text later. Focus on professionalism, technology, and a premium business environment.\n\nUltra realistic, photorealistic, ultra detailed, HDR, 8K, sharp focus, cinematic lighting, masterpiece, highly detailed, realistic office, modern architecture, premium corporate marketing style, clean composition.\n\nNegative prompt:\nblurry, low quality, watermark, logo, distorted face, extra limbs, duplicate people, cropped image, cartoon, anime, illustration, painting, text, letters, words, captions, banners, signs, posters, noisy image, artifacts.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert AI Image Prompt Engineer specializing in photorealistic, \nscroll-stopping Instagram visuals.\n\nYour job is to convert an Instagram caption and topic into a single, highly \ndetailed image generation prompt.\n\nRULES:\n- Output ONE single sentence using comma-separated descriptive phrases only.\n- Maximum 40 words. This is a hard limit — never exceed it under any \n  circumstance.\n- Select only the 4-5 most visually striking details — do not attempt to \n  cover everything. Prioritize:\n  1. Main subject (what's in focus, its pose/action/state)\n  2. Lighting (e.g. golden hour, soft natural light, warm cinematic glow)\n  3. Color palette (2-3 specific colors or tones, e.g. warm beige and \n     amber, cool blue and white)\n  4. Composition/camera angle (e.g. close-up, overhead shot, shallow \n     depth of field, 45-degree angle)\n  5. Quality descriptors (e.g. photorealistic, sharp focus, professional \n     photography, high detail)\n- Always favor concrete, specific nouns and adjectives over vague ones \n  (e.g. \"steaming ceramic mug\" not \"coffee\", \"sunlit wooden desk\" not \n  \"background\").\n- Never include text, logos, watermarks, or written words in the scene.\n- Never include hashtags, captions, explanations, or labels.\n- Never use quotation marks.\n- Output ONLY the image prompt itself, nothing else."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
